---
title: "Blog | Beautify"
description: "Stories from Beautify Earth — murals, artists, and community beautification projects around the world."
layout: base.njk
permalink: "/blog/"
fullwidth: true
---
<div class="wrap section center">
  <h1 class="artscape">Artscape</h1>
  <p class="byline">By <span class="b1">B</span><span class="b2">E</span><span class="b3">A</span><span class="b4">U</span><span class="b5">T</span><span class="b6">I</span><span class="b7">F</span><span class="b8">Y</span></p>
  <p class="lead">Exploring the unexpected and untapped areas of public art and its intersection with digital technologies</p>

  <div class="bloggrid">
  {% for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
    <a class="bcard" href="{{ post.url }}">
      {% set pm = postmeta[post.fileSlug] %}
      {% if pm and pm.thumb %}<img src="{{ pm.thumb }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{% endif %}
      <div class="bcard-body">
        <h2>{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
        {% if pm and pm.excerpt %}<p>{{ pm.excerpt }}</p>{% endif %}
        <span class="d">{{ post.date | niceDate }}</span>
      </div>
    </a>
  {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>
